NBT-AAD patch: deferred video acknowledgements for decoder flow control.
Upstream: https://github.com/Sq00ky/Supra-iDrive6-Android-Auto commit 4328560 (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0).
Apply after scripts/aa_session_overlay.py.

